1
00:02:04,212 --> 00:02:11,222
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:15,919
Brother, stop!
Stop! Alaaddin

3
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:19,040
-Leave him! Leave him!
-Get back!

4
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:23,319
Brother! Brother!

5
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:26,079
You are a dead man, Alaaddin.

6
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,399
Who could save you now?

7
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:31,519
Brother!

8
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:37,879
-Gonca? Gonca!
-Gonca?

9
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:42,039
-Gonca? Gonca.
-Leave her!

10
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:44,199
Leave my sister!

11
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:47,239
-Gonca.
-Gonca, are you alright?

12
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,039
I'm good.

13
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:51,759
This is because of you!

14
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:55,199
Enough! Enough!
Brother, stop already!

15
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:58,439
He doesn't see what he did and still blames me!

16
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,879
Hasan, bring the bag!

17
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:04,039
We need to wrap the wound!

18
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:05,719
Gokmen!

19
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,919
Let him bring it.

20
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:15,999
-Are you alright?
-I'm good.

21
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:19,159
Get your hand off!

22
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,519
Give it to me.

23
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:28,679
Come to me. Let me wrap it.

24
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,959
Know your place, Alaaddin.

25
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:35,359
Know your place! Otherwise
I will have to kill you!

26
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:38,839
Wait, Gonca.

27
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:52,719
My Shahzade, Gorklu Khan
is advancing to Yenisehir.

28
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,959
What are you saying?

29
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:59,599
Alps!
Get on horses!

30
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:04,319
'm good. Just go.
Please.

31
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:08,799
We're going to Yenisehir!

32
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:14,079
Alaaddin!

33
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:16,719
I owed you a life.

34
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,319
So I spared your life.

35
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:21,119
I'll show no mercy anymore!

36
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:23,959
With a tiny mistake of
yours, I will take your life.

37
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:27,359
It's only Allah Who takes
and gives lives, Mehmed Bey.

38
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:30,239
I stopped for Gonca's sake.

39
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:32,399
But next time

40
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:34,879
...I will show no mercy.

41
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:37,919
Let's go!

42
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:53,479
While you are dying here, Gorklu
Khan is burning Yenisehir down.

43
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:57,199
We're destroying you from all directions, Osman!

44
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,439
Soldiers of Kayi!

45
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:15,039
Get up!

46
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:33,239
It is...

47
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:36,639
It's the day of reckoning today!

48
00:05:57,640 --> 00:06:01,199
You will pay for every life you harm

49
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:07,359
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

50
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:14,999
-Allah is the greatest!
-Nokers.

51
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:19,159
Leave nobody alive!

52
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:38,239
All the accounts will be settled today!

53
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:43,119
-Come on, alps!
-Allah is the greatest!

54
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:16,239
Alps! Stop them!

55
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,599
Break their hopes! Come on!

56
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:22,119
We won't let them get inside the palace!

57
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:30,479
Mongolian dog Gorklu Khan!
Yenisehir will be your death!

58
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:40,159
You will never get the princess!

59
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:49,159
Yenisehir will burn to ashes...

60
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:51,839
...with my wrath.

61
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:55,119
Kill everyone!

62
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,919
Nokers search the dungeon. There is nobody.

63
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,319
Princess must be in Osman's palace.

64
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:02,319
Go there.

65
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:04,799
Find her.

66
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:09,039
-Bala!
-Close the doors, alps!

67
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:18,319
Close the doors!

68
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:31,799
You're trying in vain, Osman.

69
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:47,959
I will kill you and take my revenge.

70
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,399
These lands where you came for revenge...

71
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:53,559
..will be your death.

72
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,199
You'll take revenge?

73
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:02,879
Who are you to take revenge from me?

74
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,839
Allah is the greatest!

75
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:39,719
Who are you? Where did you come from?

76
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:42,479
As long as you attack the innocent,

77
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:45,679
...you will see us all against you.

78
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:15,439
Nokers, we were to hold Osman and we did!

79
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:18,359
Get back!

80
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:42,479
You're running off again!

81
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,479
Uraz Bey.

82
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:51,799
-Are you alright?
-Thanks to Allah, my Bey.

83
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,679
Alps, check the wounded.

84
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,159
Put out all the fires.

85
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:59,919
My Bey we can handle here.

86
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:05,359
You go to the city. For
the sake of State of Osman.

87
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:09,639
Do not worry. In the end..

88
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:12,319
..in the end we will be victorious.

89
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:16,479
I swear we will.

90
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:19,239
Come on alps.

91
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:21,759
We're heading to Yenisehir.

92
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:28,679
Come on hurry! We will strike them from behind!

93
00:11:28,760 --> 00:11:32,039
We will show them Yenisehir is not unguarded!

94
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:34,319
Come on.

95
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:46,279
Tong Chu, leave my most skilled soldier here.

96
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:49,159
Osman will come after me.

97
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:51,959
He will report his every move.

98
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:54,639
As you command Emir Gorklu Khan

99
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,799
Burn it all!

100
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:59,999
If we fall, Yenisehir will fall! Hold on!

101
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:07,439
Hold the doors! Hold them!

102
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:16,159
Hold on!

103
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:23,319
Hold on!

104
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:25,799
The Righteous!

105
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:28,959
Yenisehir was made home with martyr blood!

106
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:32,959
You will know not to pass from these lands!

107
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:59,759
Nokers are nearing the palace!
The lines of defence are broken!

108
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:01,599
They're at the doors, come on!

109
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:04,479
-Bala! Bala!
-Come on.

110
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,559
Alps hold on!

111
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:08,159
We're holding the palace!

112
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:12,599
To the passages! Come on!

113
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:36,279
Break the door!

114
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:46,399
-Come on!
-Take positions!

115
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:50,599
-To arms!
-Come on!

116
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:55,159
Come on! With haste!

117
00:14:16,520 --> 00:14:19,559
Alps, hold the door!

118
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:23,439
-Come on!
-There are no more places to defend!

119
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:25,039
Now it is time to attack!

120
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:28,439
You won't have Yenisehir
without getting past me first!

121
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:32,959
Alps, come on to the doors!

122
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:41,639
Hold each place! Do not give up!

123
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:44,719
Come on!

124
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:55,239
This city..

125
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:58,959
..will burn with my wrath!

126
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:05,319
I will take both your brave
hearts and the princess!

127
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:07,959
Get ready.

128
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:13,319
Now!

129
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:18,159
You dogs!

130
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:21,079
Drown them with arrows!

131
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:24,959
The Righteous!

132
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:44,359
Attack valiants!

133
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:46,919
We will banish these dogs from Yenisehir!

134
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:49,839
Allah is the greatest! Come on!

135
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:11,519
I will turn these lands into hell..

136
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:14,759
..until I get the princess!

137
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:18,479
Tell that to Osman!

138
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:22,559
The Righteous!

139
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:28,679
Bring ladders! Climb the walls!

140
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,999
The Righteous!

141
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:48,399
Come, you dogs!

142
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:18,599
Come you dogs!

143
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:05,599
Protect Fatma!

144
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:17,319
Nokers! We are done here!

145
00:19:18,520 --> 00:19:21,999
Fall back!

146
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:32,559
Not even one noker will leave here alive!

147
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:35,439
Attack! Allah is the greatest!

148
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:48,759
Are you alright my daughter?
-I am alright mother.

149
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:52,559
You will be alright. You are
your moms strong daughter.

150
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:58,479
Orhan.

151
00:19:58,560 --> 00:20:02,279
Thank Allah. You came right in time, son.

152
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:07,519
Sister, are you alright?

153
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:09,159
It's nothing, brother.

154
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:12,919
-Are you alright?
We're alright. Come on to the healer.

155
00:20:13,160 --> 00:20:14,639
Send word to the healers.

156
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:16,879
Carry every wounded to the healers!

157
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:20,959
Alps, build defences on the
marketplace exit, we won't let them in!

158
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:59,199
Alps, put out the fires.

159
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:02,959
Come on! Tend to the wounded!

160
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:09,799
Do not worry, we will be alright.

161
00:21:09,800 --> 00:21:12,279
We will be alright.

162
00:21:12,360 --> 00:21:14,559
They burned down Yenisehir.

163
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:18,959
They burned down everywhere.

164
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:41,679
Inna Lillahi Wa Inna Ilayhi Raji'un

165
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:47,639
Gorklu Khan.

166
00:21:47,760 --> 00:21:51,239
You burned down my Yenisehir.

167
00:21:53,280 --> 00:21:55,799
You did this to my people.

168
00:21:55,840 --> 00:21:59,519
You., you..

169
00:21:59,800 --> 00:22:03,759
Only one day.

170
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:08,079
When sun conies up, I will have you pay for this!

171
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:11,879
I will have your head and give it to my people!

172
00:22:12,040 --> 00:22:17,679
As long as I am Osman Bey.

173
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:23,799
Alps! Gather around!

174
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:31,439
Come on!

175
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:38,639
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

176
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:41,039
Mother..

177
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:50,239
Are you going to sacrifice
your life for that man?

178
00:22:50,320 --> 00:22:52,559
Did you lose your mind, Gonca?

179
00:22:52,880 --> 00:22:56,670
My brother would have killed Alaeddin
if I had not stood before him!

180
00:22:56,670 --> 00:22:58,160
Let him!

181
00:22:58,160 --> 00:23:00,079
Why do you care?

182
00:23:00,120 --> 00:23:04,959
Since when do you love him
enough to sacrifice your own life?

183
00:23:05,360 --> 00:23:09,519
I won't allow that, Gonca!
I will not allow that!

184
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,919
What is it that you will not allow, huh?

185
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:15,839
Didn't you drag me into this game?
Did you just realize what you did, mother?

186
00:23:15,840 --> 00:23:17,679
I gave you a duty!

187
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:19,879
I told you to make him fall in love with you!

188
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:22,199
I told you to burn Alaeddin!

189
00:23:22,320 --> 00:23:26,159
But you burnt yourself, my daughter!

190
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:30,999
Gonca... look, my daughter.

191
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:35,199
Look... I am your mother, Gonca!

192
00:23:37,520 --> 00:23:39,959
Did you remember your motherhood?

193
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:43,879
I will not sacrifice you for this love.

194
00:23:44,120 --> 00:23:47,719
I will not let that happen. You will
not see Alaeddin anymore, Gonca!

195
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:50,879
You will not see Alaeddin!

196
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:55,999
Gonca!

197
00:23:58,840 --> 00:24:00,359
Are you alright, my daughter?

198
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:02,599
I am alright, father. How did this happen?

199
00:24:02,840 --> 00:24:05,119
Who attacked you?

200
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:14,159
It's not important, father.

201
00:24:15,880 --> 00:24:18,639
When we were after the
Princess, some of the Alps...

202
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:21,959
What were you doing there, Mehmet?

203
00:24:22,960 --> 00:24:25,679
Didn't I give you another duty?

204
00:24:27,280 --> 00:24:29,919
Why do you say that, my Bey?

205
00:24:30,520 --> 00:24:34,119
He was fortunately there. He arrived on time.

206
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:41,159
Anyway.

207
00:24:41,600 --> 00:24:43,759
Now, let's talk about the actual issue.

208
00:24:43,800 --> 00:24:47,719
Gorklu Khan raided Yenisehir.

209
00:24:48,280 --> 00:24:53,479
Osman made a huge mistake...

210
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:57,319
...by taking that Princess captive.

211
00:24:58,440 --> 00:25:01,119
The marketplace of Yenisehir was destroyed.

212
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:03,919
Now it cannot be repaired, huh, my father?

213
00:25:04,280 --> 00:25:09,159
Right... right. Osman's marketplace...

214
00:25:09,560 --> 00:25:12,119
...and his dreams of a state were destroyed.

215
00:25:13,240 --> 00:25:15,239
With this move...

216
00:25:15,680 --> 00:25:18,079
...they were all destroyed.

217
00:25:18,560 --> 00:25:20,559
Father..

218
00:25:20,760 --> 00:25:23,079
Are you happy about this?

219
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:25,119
What about all the lives we lost?

220
00:25:25,520 --> 00:25:28,679
Don't you feel sorry for
those innocent people, father?

221
00:25:28,960 --> 00:25:31,519
How can you say that, Gonca?

222
00:25:32,480 --> 00:25:35,039
Do you think I am not in pain?

223
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:38,239
They were our people, they were our family.

224
00:25:39,760 --> 00:25:43,559
But... wasn't it Osman's duty...

225
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:46,679
...to protect his people?

226
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:52,839
I don't feel sorry for Osman.

227
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:55,439
I feel sorry for his people who are crushed..

228
00:25:55,600 --> 00:25:57,999
...under his dreams.

229
00:26:02,280 --> 00:26:06,319
Now, we will protect Kayi's..

230
00:26:06,960 --> 00:26:09,399
...people.

231
00:26:10,920 --> 00:26:15,399
We will protect what Osman could not protect.

232
00:26:17,040 --> 00:26:19,839
Come on. Get ready.

233
00:26:20,040 --> 00:26:22,799
We will go and give them our warm wishes.

234
00:26:24,560 --> 00:26:26,719
Father...

235
00:26:26,760 --> 00:26:29,159
Gonca must stay here.

236
00:26:29,200 --> 00:26:32,599
She is injured.
-Thank you, brother.

237
00:26:33,320 --> 00:26:36,519
But it is a scratch.

238
00:26:37,320 --> 00:26:41,479
I am alright. I will come.

239
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:44,679
Good then. Come on.

240
00:27:19,280 --> 00:27:22,039
We will be alright. -Father!

241
00:27:23,800 --> 00:27:26,079
Fatma...

242
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:28,679
What is this?

243
00:27:28,800 --> 00:27:31,279
A scratch, father. I am alright.

244
00:27:31,560 --> 00:27:34,159
Of my veteran daughter...

245
00:27:41,240 --> 00:27:43,439
What is the situation?

246
00:27:44,440 --> 00:27:50,359
The fact that Orhan arrived on time
reduced the number of losses, my Bey.

247
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:56,039
Thanks to Allah..

248
00:27:56,280 --> 00:27:58,359
But still, we have a lot to do.

249
00:27:58,600 --> 00:28:01,839
We must reconstruct Yenisehir.

250
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:19,879
We will.

251
00:28:22,760 --> 00:28:25,239
Of course we will.

252
00:29:14,840 --> 00:29:17,359
I will make those...

253
00:29:17,920 --> 00:29:21,159
...who did this to my people...

254
00:29:21,440 --> 00:29:24,719
...to my Alps...

255
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:27,839
...pay the price so heavily that, I swear...

256
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:32,359
...I swear..

257
00:29:33,320 --> 00:29:35,239
...I know...

258
00:29:36,080 --> 00:29:39,479
I know what to do to that dog.

259
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:47,399
Now it's time.

260
00:30:44,080 --> 00:30:45,919
Emir Hadhrat.

261
00:30:46,080 --> 00:30:48,599
You set the biggest trap.

262
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:51,879
For Osman's head..

263
00:30:52,040 --> 00:30:54,519
Don't you also want that?

264
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:57,199
I want his head!

265
00:30:58,840 --> 00:31:01,959
I want to rule Yenisehir...

266
00:31:02,040 --> 00:31:05,679
...and Bilecik after Osman dies.

267
00:31:06,600 --> 00:31:08,799
If Emir Hadhrat allows..

268
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:12,039
You chose the right side, Lord.

269
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:15,639
You will get the things you want.

270
00:31:16,120 --> 00:31:20,479
Now go. Prepare your soldiers.

271
00:31:20,600 --> 00:31:23,799
We will kill them all.

272
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:46,759
You stopped us for no reason, Bala Hatun!

273
00:31:46,880 --> 00:31:48,559
If we went to the frontiers marketplace...

274
00:31:48,600 --> 00:31:51,999
...our goods would not be damaged.

275
00:31:53,800 --> 00:31:57,519
Your lives and goods were entrusted to us.

276
00:31:57,600 --> 00:31:59,679
We are the ones who suffer the most.

277
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:04,119
All of your lost goods will
be covered. Don't worry.

278
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:07,759
We want to go to the frontiers marketplace!
We want to go to the frontiers marketplace!

279
00:32:07,840 --> 00:32:11,279
We want to go to the frontiers marketplace!

280
00:32:11,320 --> 00:32:13,199
People!

281
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:15,999
Today is the day of unity.

282
00:32:16,080 --> 00:32:18,999
If we don't unite, we will be ruined

283
00:32:19,080 --> 00:32:20,959
Bala Hatun is right.

284
00:32:21,040 --> 00:32:23,399
They raid wherever we go.

285
00:32:23,520 --> 00:32:25,039
We should not go.

286
00:32:25,080 --> 00:32:29,599
Yenisehir is entrusted to us!

287
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:32,719
We are not going anywhere!

288
00:32:32,760 --> 00:32:34,359
We are here! We will stay here!

289
00:32:34,400 --> 00:32:36,279
Those who want to stay may stay...

290
00:32:36,320 --> 00:32:40,159
But we are going to the
frontiers marketplace. Come on.

291
00:32:57,520 --> 00:33:01,119
Get well soon, the people of Yenisehir!

292
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:04,479
We came to share your sorrow!

293
00:33:08,080 --> 00:33:11,879
Are the doors of the frontiers
marketplace still open for us, Yakup Bey?

294
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:15,719
Always, always.

295
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:44,199
Attention! Osman Bey!

296
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:50,919
My Bey, all of our Alps are ready...

297
00:33:50,920 --> 00:33:52,639
...to go after Gorklu Khan.

298
00:33:52,760 --> 00:33:55,959
Even the injured ones want to join.

299
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:58,599
Trackers are on the way.

300
00:33:58,640 --> 00:34:00,799
We will soon find out where they went.

301
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:03,239
If we hurry, we can catch them, my Bey.

302
00:34:03,280 --> 00:34:06,439
We must not come back before
we take that dog's head, my Bey!

303
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:08,679
Revenge is a must now!

304
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,224
Karaali.
-My Shahzade.

305
00:34:10,235 --> 00:34:11,679
Tell the Alps to get ready.

306
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:13,399
We will go after Gorklu Khan.

307
00:34:13,480 --> 00:34:16,079
We will not hit Gorklu Khan.

308
00:34:22,800 --> 00:34:24,599
He is expecting us to chase him.

309
00:34:24,760 --> 00:34:26,839
Now is not the time.

310
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:32,478
For what, father?

311
00:34:43,159 --> 00:34:45,518
That dastard hurt us.

312
00:34:45,600 --> 00:34:47,839
He will not get away with this.

313
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:49,839
We will go there.

314
00:34:50,120 --> 00:34:53,438
You will do as I say!

315
00:34:58,440 --> 00:35:03,759
My Bey, how will people trust
us if we don't go after this dog?

316
00:35:04,040 --> 00:35:06,199
If we don't cut his head

317
00:35:06,280 --> 00:35:08,679
If we don't punish him for this...
-Enough!

318
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:10,119
It's not enough, my Bey!

319
00:35:10,240 --> 00:35:12,159
Go away!

320
00:35:12,280 --> 00:35:14,159
Get out of here!

321
00:35:18,080 --> 00:35:20,399
You have no place here anymore.

322
00:35:35,080 --> 00:35:37,399
Okay, father.

323
00:35:56,120 --> 00:35:58,279
If there is no battle

324
00:35:58,840 --> 00:36:02,559
then there is no need for a sword.

325
00:36:03,480 --> 00:36:06,559
Goodbye.

326
00:36:37,480 --> 00:36:39,559
You tricked people for no reason.

327
00:36:39,560 --> 00:36:42,599
It wouldn't have happened like
this if you hadn't took people...

328
00:36:42,600 --> 00:36:46,159
...away from the Frontier marketplace.
-What do you mean, Saadet Hatun?

329
00:36:46,160 --> 00:36:49,279
Are Mongols our enemy alone?
Are they not your enemies too?

330
00:36:49,400 --> 00:36:52,719
How do you know they will not
attack the frontier marketplace?

331
00:36:53,360 --> 00:36:56,319
You are the ones who provoked Mongols,

332
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:58,319
and people are suffering from it.

333
00:36:58,600 --> 00:37:02,599
If you hadn't kidnapped the Princess,
they wouldn't have attacked Yenisehir.

334
00:37:02,680 --> 00:37:04,999
If Princess had married Gorklu Khan

335
00:37:05,040 --> 00:37:07,879
Byzantines and Mongols
would have made an alliance.

336
00:37:07,880 --> 00:37:11,399
Not only us, you will be crushed as well.

337
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:14,119
Do not turn a blind eye to the truth.

338
00:37:14,320 --> 00:37:17,759
You're the only ones who
know the truth, is that so?

339
00:37:21,320 --> 00:37:23,359
Orhan?

340
00:37:23,800 --> 00:37:27,679
What happened, son? Where
are you going without your sword?

341
00:37:32,320 --> 00:37:35,999
I have no sword to swing for Osman Bey anymore.

342
00:37:52,680 --> 00:37:55,279
Your son is so furious.

343
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:59,199
But his fury will burn him first.

344
00:37:59,280 --> 00:38:02,719
It is not your place to talk about my son.

345
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:05,279
No, it is.

346
00:38:05,360 --> 00:38:08,719
Your children exceed the limits way too much.

347
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:10,719
Now, they hurt themselves.

348
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:13,039
But if they don't learn their lessons,

349
00:38:13,160 --> 00:38:15,559
and if they make mistakes again

350
00:38:15,640 --> 00:38:18,799
then they have no lives to hurt.

351
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:22,319
Are you threatening us?

352
00:38:32,480 --> 00:38:36,839
Osman Bey, you dismissed your child

353
00:38:37,080 --> 00:38:38,839
but he's telling the truth.

354
00:38:38,920 --> 00:38:42,319
You have the option to give
the Princess and get rid of it,

355
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:45,719
but you're choosing the hard way.

356
00:38:46,240 --> 00:38:48,279
Never.

357
00:38:49,920 --> 00:38:52,719
-Never.
-Osman Bey.

358
00:38:53,120 --> 00:38:56,399
You're not the only one in pain.

359
00:38:56,680 --> 00:38:59,599
The whole community is suffering.

360
00:39:00,240 --> 00:39:03,399
You're putting these people in danger.

361
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:05,639
No.

362
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:08,999
I will not let you turn our lands into hell.

363
00:39:09,080 --> 00:39:11,919
Yakup Bey.

364
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:14,119
I'll do whatever it takes to

365
00:39:14,240 --> 00:39:17,039
protect this heavenly lands.

366
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:21,199
If I need to go to hell for this

367
00:39:21,400 --> 00:39:23,399
I'll go there too.

368
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:25,999
You will give the Princess, Osman Bey.

369
00:39:26,040 --> 00:39:28,039
Enough.

370
00:39:37,360 --> 00:39:40,039
Yakup Bey.

371
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:44,119
If we give the Princess

372
00:39:44,200 --> 00:39:47,839
then we will suffer ten times more than this.

373
00:39:48,360 --> 00:39:51,479
Can you still not see it?

374
00:39:52,600 --> 00:39:56,719
Of course we will have
hardships and we will be beaten.

375
00:39:56,840 --> 00:39:59,279
But

376
00:39:59,360 --> 00:40:02,479
otherwise

377
00:40:03,040 --> 00:40:05,839
then we will disappear.

378
00:40:10,440 --> 00:40:12,759
What do you think will happen?

379
00:40:13,200 --> 00:40:15,959
How are they going to destroy us?

380
00:40:16,120 --> 00:40:17,959
Yakup Bey.

381
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:23,079
How did they collapse the state of Seljuks

382
00:40:23,160 --> 00:40:25,079
and took away

383
00:40:25,560 --> 00:40:28,039
what they ruled?

384
00:40:29,000 --> 00:40:30,519
It was not enough for them.

385
00:40:30,600 --> 00:40:33,119
They will designate it as their headquarters

386
00:40:33,360 --> 00:40:36,559
and they will move towards the west.

387
00:40:38,640 --> 00:40:40,919
I'll stand against them.

388
00:40:41,000 --> 00:40:44,359
I will be their first target.

389
00:40:47,080 --> 00:40:49,759
But if they surpass me

390
00:40:50,120 --> 00:40:53,639
then they will come to you.

391
00:40:55,360 --> 00:40:58,159
First they will make you pay taxes.

392
00:40:58,840 --> 00:41:01,119
But

393
00:41:01,760 --> 00:41:05,439
if you don't make another deal with them.

394
00:41:10,120 --> 00:41:12,519
It will not be enough.

395
00:41:12,640 --> 00:41:17,039
Whatever they did to Konya,
they will do the same to Kutahya.

396
00:41:18,320 --> 00:41:21,879
They will put a governor over you.

397
00:41:24,160 --> 00:41:27,359
They will destroy Karesi and Candar

398
00:41:30,680 --> 00:41:33,359
and then it will be your turn.

399
00:41:34,080 --> 00:41:36,719
Then they will destroy you.

400
00:41:38,600 --> 00:41:42,879
This is why Byzantine gave the Princess.

401
00:41:46,880 --> 00:41:49,799
To delay things.

402
00:41:50,200 --> 00:41:55,239
There's no need to switch plans.

403
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:05,479
You cannot hide the Princess forever, Osman.

404
00:42:05,640 --> 00:42:09,239
-Gorklu Khan will find her...
-Don't worry.

405
00:42:09,520 --> 00:42:13,239
Gorklu Khan cannot hide from my sword forever.

406
00:42:13,360 --> 00:42:15,919
It is time.

407
00:42:19,880 --> 00:42:22,599
Osman!

408
00:42:24,040 --> 00:42:26,559
My Bey, Orhan...

409
00:42:32,520 --> 00:42:34,239
If you'll excuse us, Yakup Bey...

410
00:42:35,280 --> 00:42:37,999
Sure, Osman Bey.

411
00:42:38,600 --> 00:42:42,199
Think about what I've said.

412
00:42:49,680 --> 00:42:52,399
Osman, Orhan was leaving without his sword.

413
00:42:52,400 --> 00:42:55,959
Crusaders and Mongols are
waiting for an opportunity to attack us.

414
00:42:55,960 --> 00:42:59,159
What if something happens again?
What if they set traps?

415
00:42:59,200 --> 00:43:01,359
He will suffer what's will happen to him.

416
00:43:01,480 --> 00:43:03,959
This was his decision.

417
00:43:18,600 --> 00:43:20,399
Don't worry.

418
00:43:21,080 --> 00:43:23,639
Don't worry.

419
00:43:38,760 --> 00:43:41,839
My Sultan, Gorklu Khan's men...

420
00:43:45,840 --> 00:43:47,999
Keep me informed about it.

421
00:43:48,200 --> 00:43:50,279
Yes, my Sultan.

422
00:43:51,520 --> 00:43:53,479
You wait.

423
00:44:00,160 --> 00:44:03,559
What does Osman think? Why
hasn't he gone after Gorklu Khan?

424
00:44:03,640 --> 00:44:06,239
Osman is worried a lot. The attack on Yenisehir...

425
00:44:06,280 --> 00:44:07,919
...feels heavy for him.

426
00:44:07,960 --> 00:44:12,759
He crushed his Shahzade Orhan
because he wanted revenge.

427
00:44:13,400 --> 00:44:15,999
It will take time for him to gain strength.

428
00:44:16,040 --> 00:44:20,679
Gorklu Khan will soon crush him.
What about the Princess? Where is she?

429
00:44:21,080 --> 00:44:23,319
We couldn't find her yet.

430
00:44:23,360 --> 00:44:25,439
Osman is keeping her place as a secret.

431
00:44:25,600 --> 00:44:28,159
Tell Yakup who sees himself as Sultan,

432
00:44:28,320 --> 00:44:31,359
that if he cannot find the
Princess in the lands he rules...

433
00:44:31,440 --> 00:44:33,039
...his end is clear...

434
00:44:33,200 --> 00:44:37,119
...we will kill him before Osman.

435
00:44:44,280 --> 00:44:48,319
People are going to the
Frontier marketplace, Yakup Bey.

436
00:44:48,600 --> 00:44:50,879
Orhan stood up to Osman.

437
00:44:51,080 --> 00:44:53,239
He left.

438
00:44:53,800 --> 00:44:57,519
Osman's household is ruining, Hatun.

439
00:44:59,280 --> 00:45:02,919
First Orhan, and then the others.

440
00:45:03,160 --> 00:45:06,159
Everyone will see the truth.

441
00:45:06,280 --> 00:45:08,999
Very well.

442
00:45:09,560 --> 00:45:10,959
Come on.

443
00:45:11,200 --> 00:45:14,919
-We're setting out.
-Shut the gates!

444
00:45:26,640 --> 00:45:29,799
What's going on, Alaeddin Bey?

445
00:45:30,680 --> 00:45:32,279
By the order of Osman Bey...

446
00:45:32,280 --> 00:45:35,679
Entrances and exits to
Yenisehir have been blocked.

447
00:45:37,640 --> 00:45:39,879
What are you saying, Alaeddin?

448
00:45:40,120 --> 00:45:42,839
Open the gate, we will leave.

449
00:45:49,080 --> 00:45:53,239
On what grounds are you keeping us here?

450
00:45:53,560 --> 00:45:57,479
There is a traitor inside.

451
00:46:01,520 --> 00:46:05,519
No one will leave Yenisehir before we find him.

452
00:46:06,040 --> 00:46:08,599
Why would I care about your traitor?

453
00:46:08,720 --> 00:46:11,319
Open the gates, we will leave.

454
00:46:11,480 --> 00:46:13,279
It is the order of Osman Bey.

455
00:46:14,080 --> 00:46:16,639
I will not let anyone disobey my Bey.

456
00:46:19,680 --> 00:46:23,079
Nobody will leave Yenisehir, Yakup Bey.

457
00:46:26,800 --> 00:46:28,639
I will crush you first..

458
00:46:28,760 --> 00:46:32,279
...and then your Bey's order, Alaaddin.

459
00:46:36,720 --> 00:46:38,999
I say we'll get out.

460
00:46:39,600 --> 00:46:41,479
Open the gates.

461
00:46:42,480 --> 00:46:44,799
Alps!

462
00:46:58,120 --> 00:47:01,279
You will pay for this, Osman.

463
00:47:05,680 --> 00:47:07,919
We're going to the palace.

464
00:47:48,080 --> 00:47:50,119
What's going on, Ulgen?

465
00:47:50,920 --> 00:47:52,959
I don't know.

466
00:48:00,680 --> 00:48:04,399
-Speak quickly.
-I swear I don't know.

467
00:48:05,280 --> 00:48:07,919
-Did you tell them anything?
-No.

468
00:48:11,760 --> 00:48:13,719
You won't say a word.

469
00:48:14,040 --> 00:48:16,399
Neither you nor Cerkutay...

470
00:48:16,560 --> 00:48:20,039
...will say a single word.

471
00:48:20,800 --> 00:48:22,639
Did you hear me?

472
00:48:22,760 --> 00:48:26,319
I did. I won't talk to anyone.

473
00:48:27,480 --> 00:48:29,879
If you care about your son

474
00:48:29,920 --> 00:48:32,599
...you won't talk.

475
00:48:32,840 --> 00:48:35,439
If you two say a single word,

476
00:48:35,680 --> 00:48:39,519
...first your son and then you two..

477
00:48:39,760 --> 00:48:42,519
Don't make me say the rest, Ulgen.

478
00:48:44,320 --> 00:48:46,559
Come on.

479
00:48:56,840 --> 00:48:59,839
-Do I have permission, my Bey?
-Come in.

480
00:49:06,320 --> 00:49:08,159
My Bey, Yakup Bey wants to see you.

481
00:49:08,200 --> 00:49:09,679
Who are you..

482
00:49:09,760 --> 00:49:13,479
...not to let me leave the city?

483
00:49:14,640 --> 00:49:16,759
This is a cause of war, Osman.

484
00:49:16,960 --> 00:49:18,719
Yakup Bey.

485
00:49:18,880 --> 00:49:22,439
You always want to fight those on your own side.

486
00:49:23,200 --> 00:49:26,199
Why are you holding me here?

487
00:49:28,120 --> 00:49:30,759
Not only you.

488
00:49:32,000 --> 00:49:34,559
I'm holding everyone here.

489
00:49:36,080 --> 00:49:38,519
All the gates of the city have been closed.

490
00:49:39,040 --> 00:49:40,559
Why?

491
00:49:41,480 --> 00:49:44,519
There is a traitor in my city.

492
00:49:46,880 --> 00:49:50,719
Then find the traitor, Osman Bey.

493
00:49:51,200 --> 00:49:53,879
How could you hold the sultan?

494
00:49:56,480 --> 00:50:01,399
Are you blaming me?

495
00:50:01,520 --> 00:50:03,559
No.

496
00:50:04,120 --> 00:50:06,439
No, Yakup Bey.

497
00:50:06,520 --> 00:50:09,799
Just the opposite.
I'm protecting you.

498
00:50:10,000 --> 00:50:11,919
We should find the traitor...

499
00:50:12,080 --> 00:50:16,279
...and find out who he is working
for and who he is trying to harm.

500
00:50:16,480 --> 00:50:20,359
You will be my guests here until then.

501
00:50:20,640 --> 00:50:23,559
When we find out who he intends to harm,

502
00:50:23,840 --> 00:50:26,679
...you can leave.

503
00:50:29,680 --> 00:50:32,759
If you are hurt somehow

504
00:50:32,840 --> 00:50:36,199
...things will be much crazier and chaotic.

505
00:50:36,280 --> 00:50:38,119
And I will never let that happen.

506
00:50:38,480 --> 00:50:41,519
Nobody can hurt me.

507
00:50:42,720 --> 00:50:46,119
You are the reason of this chaos.

508
00:50:49,360 --> 00:50:50,959
This is the last time...

509
00:50:51,160 --> 00:50:53,919
...I'm forgiving your impertinence, Osman.

510
00:50:55,080 --> 00:50:57,519
For your information!

511
00:50:58,920 --> 00:51:03,639
Whoever has even a small part in this issue,

512
00:51:04,560 --> 00:51:07,039
...I won't forgive them.

513
00:51:07,560 --> 00:51:09,999
For your information.

514
00:51:15,160 --> 00:51:17,839
Yakup Bey.

515
00:51:20,320 --> 00:51:24,279
Where are you, Cerkutay?
You've ruined us.

516
00:51:24,560 --> 00:51:27,399
You've ruined us.

517
00:51:29,480 --> 00:51:31,759
Ulgen, what's going on?

518
00:51:31,880 --> 00:51:33,999
Cerkutay. Saadet...

519
00:51:34,120 --> 00:51:37,039
Saadet crossed my path and threatened me.

520
00:51:37,040 --> 00:51:41,519
"If you are going to speak, I
will kill Ghazi and you", she said.

521
00:51:41,520 --> 00:51:44,239
What will we do now, Cerkutay?

522
00:51:49,240 --> 00:51:52,159
Don't be afraid, my Ulgen.

523
00:51:54,160 --> 00:51:56,199
Nobody...

524
00:51:56,400 --> 00:52:00,079
...can hurt our son even slightly.

525
00:52:02,200 --> 00:52:04,599
But...

526
00:52:06,560 --> 00:52:09,679
We need to send Ghazi away for a while.

527
00:52:10,800 --> 00:52:13,959
How will we get out of this hell?

528
00:52:18,280 --> 00:52:20,039
Ulgen.

529
00:52:20,120 --> 00:52:23,599
Go prepare Ghazi's bag.

530
00:52:23,760 --> 00:52:26,079
I will figure something out.

531
00:52:28,560 --> 00:52:30,919
I will.

532
00:52:35,800 --> 00:52:38,319
I will, Ulgen.

533
00:52:39,080 --> 00:52:42,759
-I will.
-Mother! Mother!

534
00:52:43,000 --> 00:52:47,039
Is Gonca Hatun in Yenisehir? Did I hear right?

535
00:52:49,120 --> 00:52:51,279
My boy.

536
00:52:51,560 --> 00:52:54,919
My boy. My son.

537
00:52:55,880 --> 00:52:57,399
Now...

538
00:52:57,560 --> 00:52:59,399
...forget about Gonca Hatun.

539
00:52:59,440 --> 00:53:01,359
Your mother is preparing your bag.

540
00:53:01,360 --> 00:53:05,439
You'll be a guest somewhere else for a while.

541
00:53:06,040 --> 00:53:08,919
I'm not going anywhere! Gonca Hatun is here.

542
00:53:08,920 --> 00:53:10,199
I will stay here!

543
00:53:10,200 --> 00:53:12,119
Ghazi. Cerkutay...

544
00:53:12,280 --> 00:53:16,279
Then I need to give the duty to another alp.

545
00:53:20,400 --> 00:53:22,319
Duty?

546
00:53:25,920 --> 00:53:28,599
Things will change then.

547
00:53:32,360 --> 00:53:34,439
Yes, duty.

548
00:53:37,200 --> 00:53:40,519
Duty awaits you, Ghazi Alp.

549
00:53:51,360 --> 00:53:53,639
What will we do, father?

550
00:53:53,760 --> 00:53:55,479
Just wait here?

551
00:53:55,560 --> 00:53:58,839
-Let me burn this palace down. -Mehmed!

552
00:53:58,920 --> 00:54:01,599
Shut up!

553
00:54:02,800 --> 00:54:04,919
Osman is mad.

554
00:54:05,040 --> 00:54:09,359
He will let nobody leave the
city before he finds the traitor.

555
00:54:12,040 --> 00:54:14,679
If Cerkutay speaks

556
00:54:14,720 --> 00:54:18,359
If our plan we made on the beys is revealed,

557
00:54:19,400 --> 00:54:22,519
...my reputation will be ruined.

558
00:54:29,760 --> 00:54:32,479
We can't gather the beys behind us again.

559
00:54:33,360 --> 00:54:35,999
Cerkutay will not speak.

560
00:54:37,960 --> 00:54:40,079
Don't worry, son.

561
00:54:40,280 --> 00:54:42,919
He won't speak.

562
00:54:43,760 --> 00:54:45,959
I threatened Ulgen.

563
00:54:50,880 --> 00:54:53,239
If they care about their son

564
00:54:53,320 --> 00:54:56,239
...neither of them will speak.

565
00:54:58,840 --> 00:55:01,079
Sorry?

566
00:55:06,440 --> 00:55:08,359
What did you do?

567
00:55:08,400 --> 00:55:11,159
I did the right thing, Gonca.

568
00:55:11,240 --> 00:55:15,359
You should do the right thing at the right time.

569
00:55:16,920 --> 00:55:18,879
It's not time for mercy now.

570
00:55:19,000 --> 00:55:21,537
-Is it right to threatening
a mother with her son?

571
00:55:21,549 --> 00:55:22,399
Gonca!

572
00:55:22,440 --> 00:55:24,359
Enough, Gonca!

573
00:55:24,840 --> 00:55:26,999
Enough!

574
00:55:29,200 --> 00:55:32,199
There is no right or wrong anymore!

575
00:55:32,880 --> 00:55:35,919
All the beys stand beside us with threats.

576
00:55:36,160 --> 00:55:37,959
Did you forget that?

577
00:55:38,800 --> 00:55:40,639
If Cerkutay speaks

578
00:55:40,720 --> 00:55:44,199
...we will remain alone and be destroyed.

579
00:55:47,520 --> 00:55:49,559
Enough!

580
00:55:54,440 --> 00:55:56,319
Gonca.

581
00:55:56,480 --> 00:55:59,719
Your mother just intimidated her.

582
00:56:02,640 --> 00:56:05,599
Well done, hatun.

583
00:56:08,920 --> 00:56:11,519
We have just a few alps here.

584
00:56:11,720 --> 00:56:14,079
If Cerkutay speaks

585
00:56:14,560 --> 00:56:18,079
...none of us can get out of
this palace alive, my daughter.

586
00:56:26,360 --> 00:56:28,479
Cerkutay won't speak...

587
00:56:28,800 --> 00:56:31,239
..no matter what.

588
00:57:16,200 --> 00:57:19,519
We have a strong ally against Osman, Olivia.

589
00:57:19,600 --> 00:57:21,199
Gorklu Khan.

590
00:57:21,280 --> 00:57:24,639
Gorklu Khan will make us stronger.

591
00:57:24,840 --> 00:57:26,679
But... Osman.

592
00:57:26,840 --> 00:57:28,519
He's unpredictable.

593
00:57:28,560 --> 00:57:31,879
Gorklu Khan has a spy in Yenisehir, Olivia.

594
00:57:32,200 --> 00:57:34,999
We will know about their every step.

595
00:57:35,160 --> 00:57:40,679
Osman has worn out after the attack on Yenisehir.

596
00:57:41,200 --> 00:57:45,079
He kicked his son Orhan out of his palace.

597
00:57:46,320 --> 00:57:50,039
There will be nobody around him soon.

598
00:57:50,120 --> 00:57:51,679
Good.

599
00:57:52,160 --> 00:57:54,119
Just as we want.

600
00:57:56,240 --> 00:57:58,959
Osman is getting lonelier.

601
00:58:00,360 --> 00:58:03,239
What is our next move?

602
00:58:03,680 --> 00:58:07,639
Osman will go after Gorklu Khan to take revenge.

603
00:58:08,200 --> 00:58:12,279
And he will face an unprecedented trap there.

604
00:58:13,440 --> 00:58:15,319
While Osman and his armies are...

605
00:58:15,440 --> 00:58:17,919
...trying to find Gorklu Khan,

606
00:58:18,040 --> 00:58:22,599
...my armies will get them into a death circle.

607
00:58:23,920 --> 00:58:28,759
Good. We just need to find Princess Maria now.

608
00:58:31,280 --> 00:58:33,439
Lord Leon.

609
00:58:34,200 --> 00:58:35,159
Speak, soldier.

610
00:58:35,240 --> 00:58:37,279
Our watchmen around the castle...

611
00:58:37,400 --> 00:58:39,759
...have been knocked out and tied to a tree.

612
00:58:39,800 --> 00:58:43,559
One of them was stripped. There is a spy inside.

613
00:58:43,720 --> 00:58:46,079
Do you hear what you are saying, soldier?

614
00:58:46,120 --> 00:58:50,319
What are you waiting for? Catch the spy! Orhan!

615
00:58:52,680 --> 00:58:55,799
Catch him, soldiers.

616
00:58:55,920 --> 00:59:00,119
Lord Leon, I'm not here to fight but talk to you.

617
00:59:00,120 --> 00:59:01,839
You infiltrated into my castle.

618
00:59:01,840 --> 00:59:04,319
You will pay the price! Catch him, soldiers!

619
00:59:09,280 --> 00:59:11,279
Tell them to put their swords down!

620
00:59:11,360 --> 00:59:13,959
What are you waiting for, soldiers? Catch him!

621
00:59:30,240 --> 00:59:33,119
What is it Andra? Did you learn anything?

622
00:59:33,320 --> 00:59:35,079
Did Orhan go back to Kestel?

623
00:59:35,160 --> 00:59:36,719
Osman Bey.

624
00:59:36,880 --> 00:59:41,119
Took Kestel and Beylik from Shahzade Orhan.

625
00:59:41,600 --> 00:59:44,119
Because of him kidnapping you.

626
00:59:47,800 --> 00:59:49,559
Because of me.

627
00:59:49,760 --> 00:59:51,559
It is because of me.

628
00:59:51,760 --> 00:59:56,319
Because of me.

629
01:00:00,560 --> 01:00:02,479
I will get away, Andra.

630
01:00:02,560 --> 01:00:04,479
This visit is an opportunity.

631
01:00:04,840 --> 01:00:07,599
My Lady, your aunt will be very mad.

632
01:00:07,680 --> 01:00:09,199
I do not care.

633
01:00:09,360 --> 01:00:13,439
I do not care Andra. Orhan
gave up on everything for me.

634
01:00:13,720 --> 01:00:16,639
-I will go to him.
-Look everywhere!

635
01:00:16,880 --> 01:00:19,439
Shahzade Orhan is here!

636
01:00:21,280 --> 01:00:24,639
What is Orhan doing here?

637
01:00:26,120 --> 01:00:28,839
Andra if Orhan gets caught, it will be very bad.

638
01:00:29,040 --> 01:00:31,319
We need to help him.

639
01:00:31,360 --> 01:00:32,879
Let us go.

640
01:00:33,080 --> 01:00:34,919
Come on.

641
01:00:57,040 --> 01:00:59,039
Soldiers, catch him!

642
01:01:00,200 --> 01:01:02,799
Stop! My intention is to only speak!

643
01:01:02,920 --> 01:01:04,919
Catch him, now!

644
01:01:25,840 --> 01:01:27,799
Let go!

645
01:01:28,280 --> 01:01:30,919
I called you my blood brother!

646
01:01:31,080 --> 01:01:33,559
-Does it fit you, what you did Cerkutay?
-Don't!

647
01:01:33,840 --> 01:01:36,679
I did not do it!
I did not do it!

648
01:01:36,760 --> 01:01:39,399
I didn't do anything!

649
01:01:39,440 --> 01:01:41,839
To whom did you send word with this bird?

650
01:01:41,920 --> 01:01:43,239
To whom are you spy to?

651
01:01:43,280 --> 01:01:46,999
Don't do it, Boran Bey. Let him go.

652
01:01:48,280 --> 01:01:51,719
We let him go when he wanted, Sister Ulgen.

653
01:01:52,440 --> 01:01:55,159
But he came back to betray us.

654
01:01:55,240 --> 01:01:57,919
He came back to strike our hearts with a dagger.

655
01:01:58,040 --> 01:02:01,039
He didn't do anything.
-I didn't do anything!

656
01:02:01,080 --> 01:02:04,279
-I didn't do it! -He will pay for it.

657
01:02:04,440 --> 01:02:08,359
Alps! Take him to the court now!

658
01:02:09,160 --> 01:02:11,039
Send word to my Osman Bey.

659
01:02:11,160 --> 01:02:13,599
-Quickly!
-Move! Come on!

660
01:02:13,640 --> 01:02:15,719
-Move!
-Don't do it!

661
01:02:15,760 --> 01:02:20,479
-Move!
-Let him go, please!

662
01:02:20,760 --> 01:02:23,479
We've found the traitor in the palace.

663
01:02:44,320 --> 01:02:47,839
There are noises outside. What is it?

664
01:02:48,080 --> 01:02:49,999
We will find out now.

665
01:02:50,760 --> 01:02:53,239
Kanyumaz.

666
01:02:55,560 --> 01:02:57,759
My Sultan.

667
01:02:57,960 --> 01:02:59,519
What is happening?

668
01:02:59,560 --> 01:03:02,239
They say Osman Bey has
found the traitor, my Sultan.

669
01:03:02,280 --> 01:03:04,159
They're heading to the court.

670
01:03:11,800 --> 01:03:13,559
Did they find about Cerkutay?

671
01:03:13,680 --> 01:03:15,439
Don't speak ill, Gonca.

672
01:03:15,560 --> 01:03:17,839
May Allah prevent it.

673
01:03:18,320 --> 01:03:20,479
Come on.

674
01:03:20,680 --> 01:03:22,759
Father.

675
01:03:24,400 --> 01:03:25,879
Cerkutay.

676
01:03:26,200 --> 01:03:27,679
Has been exposed.

677
01:03:27,720 --> 01:03:29,719
Alps caught him.

678
01:03:35,800 --> 01:03:37,759
Come on!

679
01:04:39,280 --> 01:04:41,199
Bring him up.

680
01:04:45,920 --> 01:04:48,759
I will not stop beating you..

681
01:04:48,880 --> 01:04:51,039
..until you tell me who the traitor is.

682
01:04:58,760 --> 01:05:00,719
Bring him up.

683
01:05:06,280 --> 01:05:08,399
Cerkutay.

684
01:05:09,600 --> 01:05:12,919
Cerkutay.

685
01:05:13,760 --> 01:05:17,799
I've known you as my alp. I
walked to many wars with you.

686
01:05:18,040 --> 01:05:21,639
How many alps have been killed because of you.

687
01:05:21,840 --> 01:05:26,479
Don't you pity?

688
01:05:30,280 --> 01:05:34,759
How did you sell us out?

689
01:05:44,000 --> 01:05:47,199
Whoever it is that you've
been informing with that pigeon..

690
01:05:47,360 --> 01:05:52,159
..I will have you both
hanged at the walls of this city.

691
01:06:00,400 --> 01:06:04,039
-I did not betray you.
-Shut it.

692
01:06:04,640 --> 01:06:06,399
I gave you property..

693
01:06:06,680 --> 01:06:08,799
gave you power..

694
01:06:08,920 --> 01:06:11,719
..how can you do this to me?

695
01:06:11,800 --> 01:06:15,679
I told myself; "Cerkutay
won't sell himself for gold."

696
01:06:15,880 --> 01:06:19,399
"Cerkutay won't sell himself for money."

697
01:06:19,520 --> 01:06:23,239
How can you do this? How?

698
01:06:23,400 --> 01:06:26,479
Did they threaten you with your family?

699
01:06:31,320 --> 01:06:34,559
Did they threaten you with your dynasty?

700
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:41,359
If I'd known..

701
01:06:41,560 --> 01:06:44,079
..I would've killed you the moment I met you.

702
01:06:44,280 --> 01:06:45,439
However..

703
01:06:46,000 --> 01:06:48,879
..you've changed a lot,
being a prisoner for years..

704
01:06:48,920 --> 01:06:52,759
..but I couldn't notice it.

705
01:06:54,000 --> 01:06:57,039
Take him to prison.

706
01:07:04,120 --> 01:07:07,199
You will continue beating him..

707
01:07:07,760 --> 01:07:10,399
..until he tells us who the traitor is.

708
01:07:10,560 --> 01:07:13,959
We will keep hurting him..

709
01:07:15,080 --> 01:07:17,319
..until he tells the truth.

710
01:07:17,360 --> 01:07:20,759
I will personally..

711
01:07:21,040 --> 01:07:24,159
..skin him myself.

712
01:07:31,960 --> 01:07:34,479
-Take him.
-As you command, my Bey.

713
01:07:34,840 --> 01:07:36,799
Move.

714
01:07:54,680 --> 01:07:57,159
Cerkutay didn't speak, however..

715
01:07:57,280 --> 01:08:03,519
..if he does, everything will be in danger.

716
01:08:05,600 --> 01:08:07,799
Including our lives.

717
01:08:08,840 --> 01:08:11,879
Osman went completely mad.

718
01:08:11,920 --> 01:08:14,199
What will we do, father?

719
01:08:16,680 --> 01:08:18,439
Send word to Candar and..

720
01:08:19,040 --> 01:08:22,359
..Karasid Beys in secrecy.

721
01:08:22,560 --> 01:08:24,359
Tell them to bring the armies.

722
01:08:24,840 --> 01:08:26,959
To siege Yenisehir.

723
01:08:54,520 --> 01:08:56,359
You didn't leave me any choice.

724
01:08:56,439 --> 01:08:58,839
You're playing with fire, Shahzade Orhan.

725
01:08:58,920 --> 01:09:00,719
You will pay for it.

726
01:09:00,800 --> 01:09:03,679
You can not leave here alive.

727
01:09:04,160 --> 01:09:06,319
Let go of Olivia.

728
01:09:11,200 --> 01:09:12,479
Orhan.

729
01:09:12,680 --> 01:09:15,158
What are you doing?

730
01:09:18,200 --> 01:09:20,118
I will tell you soon.

731
01:09:20,120 --> 01:09:21,919
I will tell you all, Holofira.

732
01:09:22,399 --> 01:09:24,719
Lord, you've seen it with your own eyes.

733
01:09:25,040 --> 01:09:27,919
I didn't kill a single soldier of yours.

734
01:09:28,160 --> 01:09:30,238
I didn't come here as an enemy.

735
01:09:30,520 --> 01:09:32,439
My intention is to provide peace.

736
01:09:32,600 --> 01:09:36,118
By sneaking into my castle and spying around?

737
01:09:36,279 --> 01:09:41,359
We will find a mutual way
and you will listen, Lord.

738
01:09:43,120 --> 01:09:47,078
Don't you want Princess Maria?

739
01:09:52,840 --> 01:09:55,599
I will give you her.

740
01:09:57,760 --> 01:09:59,839
How will you do that?

741
01:09:59,960 --> 01:10:01,999
Despite your father?

742
01:10:02,120 --> 01:10:04,439
How can we trust you?

743
01:10:05,840 --> 01:10:07,879
The arrogance of Osman Bey..

744
01:10:08,000 --> 01:10:10,799
..destroyed Yenisehir!

745
01:10:16,120 --> 01:10:18,439
He took my beylik, my castle from me..

746
01:10:18,640 --> 01:10:21,519
..on top of not admitting his own mistakes!

747
01:10:24,280 --> 01:10:27,079
Osman Bey..

748
01:10:27,760 --> 01:10:30,519
..took my father from me.

749
01:10:31,560 --> 01:10:33,359
Orhan.

750
01:10:36,640 --> 01:10:38,279
Princess Maria.

751
01:10:38,400 --> 01:10:41,679
Brought nothing but trouble to us.

752
01:10:42,160 --> 01:10:43,919
I will hand her over to you..

753
01:10:44,200 --> 01:10:47,279
..and provide peace to my people.

754
01:10:50,360 --> 01:10:52,199
I will do this..

755
01:10:54,280 --> 01:10:57,919
..even if it means..

756
01:10:59,680 --> 01:11:01,879
..dying by my father's hands.

757
01:11:14,240 --> 01:11:16,839
It is your decision now.

758
01:11:18,640 --> 01:11:21,439
Shahzade Orhan.

759
01:11:25,080 --> 01:11:29,239
Tomorrow, you will bring
the Princess with my soldiers.

760
01:11:30,560 --> 01:11:32,959
Do not worry, Lord.

761
01:11:33,440 --> 01:11:36,719
We both will get what we want.

762
01:12:48,200 --> 01:12:52,359
Fatma... Where are we going? My
brother always keeps an eye on me.

763
01:12:52,720 --> 01:12:54,519
I informed the Sisters.

764
01:12:54,520 --> 01:12:57,119
They will let us know if he comes.

765
01:12:58,040 --> 01:13:00,399
I... wanted you to see Ghazi.

766
01:13:00,680 --> 01:13:02,879
You did well.

767
01:13:16,200 --> 01:13:19,599
Ghazi Alp. -Gonca Hatun!

768
01:13:22,200 --> 01:13:25,039
My Gonca Hatun!

769
01:13:28,520 --> 01:13:31,839
Gonca Hatun... They did
not let me leave the kitchen!

770
01:13:32,040 --> 01:13:35,239
My mother gets jealous when I want to see you!

771
01:13:35,360 --> 01:13:37,959
Look at him...

772
01:13:38,000 --> 01:13:40,239
Let me look at you.

773
01:13:40,480 --> 01:13:43,199
-You grew up a little.
-Really?

774
01:13:43,600 --> 01:13:45,959
I grew up, right?

775
01:13:46,480 --> 01:13:50,479
I am old enough to get
married, right, Gonca Hatun?

776
01:13:52,960 --> 01:13:55,199
But...

777
01:13:59,440 --> 01:14:01,719
Ooo, Ghazi Alp...

778
01:14:02,040 --> 01:14:03,559
You are also here, huh?

779
01:14:03,600 --> 01:14:06,719
Why did you come, Shahzade?
Do not come between us!

780
01:14:06,800 --> 01:14:08,359
I saw Gonca Hatun first!

781
01:14:08,400 --> 01:14:10,879
I loved her first!

782
01:14:12,280 --> 01:14:13,959
No, you are wrong.

783
01:14:14,960 --> 01:14:18,399
I was the first one to see and love her.

784
01:14:19,880 --> 01:14:22,319
Is he telling the truth?

785
01:14:24,960 --> 01:14:26,879
Yes, what can we do?

786
01:14:27,560 --> 01:14:30,279
He was the first one to see me.

787
01:14:31,760 --> 01:14:35,399
Then... we are unfortunate today.

788
01:14:40,640 --> 01:14:43,399
What am I going to do now, huh?

789
01:14:45,280 --> 01:14:48,199
But, no... No, Gonca Hatun!

790
01:14:48,280 --> 01:14:51,599
You don't love this Shahzade!

791
01:14:51,960 --> 01:14:55,479
Is that so? -Yes!

792
01:14:56,440 --> 01:14:58,439
Ghazi... Come on.

793
01:14:58,480 --> 01:15:00,759
Come on, come.

794
01:15:01,320 --> 01:15:04,877
Gonca Hatun, you do
not love him! You don't!

795
01:15:04,889 --> 01:15:06,079
Come on!

796
01:15:06,280 --> 01:15:09,399
Look at him..

797
01:15:11,600 --> 01:15:13,479
Alaeddin...

798
01:15:15,920 --> 01:15:17,679
What happened?

799
01:15:17,760 --> 01:15:21,559
I don't understand! It is all too complicated!

800
01:15:21,960 --> 01:15:24,199
I don't know, Gonca.

801
01:15:27,400 --> 01:15:31,039
How are you? How is your wound? Is it better now?

802
01:15:34,960 --> 01:15:37,279
I am alright.

803
01:15:44,120 --> 01:15:47,199
I was afraid that something would happen to you.

804
01:15:50,320 --> 01:15:52,479
Don't be scared.

805
01:15:56,440 --> 01:15:59,119
But... promise me.

806
01:16:00,520 --> 01:16:03,079
You will not do what you did today again.

807
01:16:03,480 --> 01:16:06,639
You will not risk your own
life to protect me, Gonca.

808
01:16:06,920 --> 01:16:07,799
No...

809
01:16:09,680 --> 01:16:12,279
You cannot ask this from me, Alaeddin.

810
01:16:15,600 --> 01:16:18,879
I owe you a lot.

811
01:16:21,680 --> 01:16:23,839
Gonca..

812
01:16:23,920 --> 01:16:26,879
You don't owe me anything.

813
01:16:27,800 --> 01:16:31,799
Your life has become my life.

814
01:16:32,000 --> 01:16:35,679
Do not hurt it any more while trying to save it.

815
01:16:38,000 --> 01:16:40,639
Gazelle-eyed Hatun.

816
01:16:43,880 --> 01:16:46,639
Can I come in, my Shahzade?

817
01:16:47,520 --> 01:16:49,919
Come in.

818
01:16:53,560 --> 01:16:55,199
My Shahzade...

819
01:16:55,520 --> 01:16:58,599
Osman Bey is waiting for you.

820
01:17:04,360 --> 01:17:05,879
I am coming, Ulgen Hatun.

821
01:17:13,920 --> 01:17:16,679
I am leaving. -Alright.

822
01:17:25,640 --> 01:17:28,519
How are we going to tell
this to Alaeddin, my Osman?

823
01:17:29,200 --> 01:17:32,359
You are right, my Bala...
You are right, but..

824
01:17:34,720 --> 01:17:37,519
We need to tell him.

825
01:17:37,680 --> 01:17:40,359
My Alaeddin Ali is strong.

826
01:17:43,920 --> 01:17:45,879
He can get over this.

827
01:17:45,920 --> 01:17:48,559
Right... But it will be hard.

828
01:17:48,640 --> 01:17:50,519
It will be too hard.

829
01:17:50,600 --> 01:17:53,399
When have we ever faced something easy?

830
01:17:54,560 --> 01:17:56,999
Can I come in, my Bey?

831
01:17:59,880 --> 01:18:03,119
Come in...

832
01:18:05,960 --> 01:18:08,599
Father...

833
01:18:09,920 --> 01:18:11,759
We have something to tell you.

834
01:18:11,840 --> 01:18:13,759
Father, what is going on?

835
01:18:13,960 --> 01:18:16,199
How is Cerkutay Bey a traitor?

836
01:18:21,080 --> 01:18:23,799
We have other things to tell you...

837
01:18:24,040 --> 01:18:27,239
...and also, we have that issue about Cerkutay.

838
01:18:27,840 --> 01:18:29,439
My son.

839
01:18:29,520 --> 01:18:32,039
The issue is about Yakup Bey..

840
01:18:32,160 --> 01:18:34,479
...and Gonca.

841
01:18:37,560 --> 01:18:39,199
Gonca?

842
01:18:43,040 --> 01:18:45,519
They knew that we would take Karacelasun...

843
01:18:46,880 --> 01:18:49,119
...from the inn...

844
01:18:52,000 --> 01:18:54,119
...because Gonca told them.

845
01:19:00,800 --> 01:19:04,439
She approached you because
her mother told her to do it.

846
01:19:09,240 --> 01:19:11,119
My son.

847
01:19:12,200 --> 01:19:16,519
I know that it is hard.
It is really hard.

848
01:19:17,800 --> 01:19:20,399
But you will stay strong.

849
01:19:26,560 --> 01:19:29,559
It was all a game, huh?

850
01:19:32,400 --> 01:19:36,799
Would someone sacrifice
her life for a game, father?

851
01:19:41,960 --> 01:19:43,879
Son.

852
01:19:44,200 --> 01:19:46,719
It is not about Gonca only.

853
01:19:46,800 --> 01:19:48,679
Son.

854
01:19:48,920 --> 01:19:52,599
Yakup Bey is trying to trick
us at every opportunity he gets.

855
01:19:52,680 --> 01:19:54,599
So,

856
01:19:54,760 --> 01:19:57,239
we don't know who to trust.

857
01:19:57,400 --> 01:20:00,279
We need to be careful.

858
01:20:03,360 --> 01:20:05,839
We will not trust, father.

859
01:20:07,160 --> 01:20:09,799
We will not.

860
01:20:11,680 --> 01:20:14,039
May I come in, my Bey?

861
01:20:14,440 --> 01:20:16,839
Come on in.

862
01:20:23,680 --> 01:20:28,439
My Bey, I've sent Ghazi.

863
01:20:28,680 --> 01:20:31,639
Do not let him see his father in that state.

864
01:20:32,240 --> 01:20:34,759
We will have to suffer.

865
01:21:08,240 --> 01:21:11,799
Shame on you!

866
01:21:47,680 --> 01:21:51,639
Calm down, it will be over.

867
01:24:16,240 --> 01:24:18,039
Father.

868
01:24:18,280 --> 01:24:21,999
We need to shoot Cerkutay.

869
01:24:25,480 --> 01:24:27,319
No.

870
01:24:28,520 --> 01:24:32,999
I will not kill the soldier
who bows to the sword,

871
01:24:33,920 --> 01:24:36,479
I applaud him.

872
01:24:42,160 --> 01:24:46,399
Whoever betrays the hand that feeds him

873
01:24:49,520 --> 01:24:52,679
is killed by the same hand

874
01:24:56,760 --> 01:24:59,199
Everything will be revealed, including

875
01:24:59,440 --> 01:25:02,439
who do you work for and what did you do.

876
01:25:12,920 --> 01:25:16,399
But you will not live until then.

877
01:26:35,600 --> 01:26:39,999
My Bey.

878
01:26:42,240 --> 01:26:46,479
We have news from the scouts,
Gorklu Khan's place has been discovered.

879
01:26:58,960 --> 01:27:02,999
Gorklu Khan went to the frontier
marketplace and met Yakup Bey twice,

880
01:27:03,040 --> 01:27:05,119
we don't know what they are up to.

881
01:27:05,240 --> 01:27:07,319
He met Yakup Bey

882
01:27:07,720 --> 01:27:09,679
and attacked Yenisehir, right?

883
01:27:12,640 --> 01:27:16,079
Ulgen? Are you all right?

884
01:27:17,840 --> 01:27:20,279
Cerkutay

885
01:27:20,520 --> 01:27:22,799
say it now.

886
01:27:23,480 --> 01:27:26,159
What's he going to say?

887
01:27:35,160 --> 01:27:36,639
My Bey.

888
01:27:37,080 --> 01:27:39,559
I made a mistake.

889
01:27:40,640 --> 01:27:43,239
Yakup Bey

890
01:27:45,240 --> 01:27:47,879
forced me into spying.

891
01:27:51,200 --> 01:27:53,399
What?

892
01:27:56,120 --> 01:27:58,159
I didn't do it, my Bey.

893
01:27:59,720 --> 01:28:03,639
I didn't say anything that
would put you in a hard spot.

894
01:28:04,680 --> 01:28:08,079
I didn't, I wasted his time.

895
01:28:08,160 --> 01:28:10,799
I acted like I'm spying.

896
01:28:11,160 --> 01:28:13,319
But I didn't.

897
01:28:15,280 --> 01:28:17,599
If it was about my life

898
01:28:18,080 --> 01:28:20,439
I'm willing to die to get rid of this

899
01:28:20,680 --> 01:28:23,639
but he left me no other choice.

900
01:28:24,560 --> 01:28:27,039
He threatened to

901
01:28:27,360 --> 01:28:30,199
kill my family, my child.

902
01:28:46,280 --> 01:28:48,999
Punish me, my Bey.

903
01:28:50,960 --> 01:28:53,439
But protect my family

904
01:28:53,880 --> 01:28:55,959
and my child.

905
01:28:57,480 --> 01:29:00,399
Just like before.

906
01:29:02,960 --> 01:29:05,879
Why didn't you tell me this, Cerkutay?

907
01:29:07,480 --> 01:29:10,079
Why didn't you tell me this, Cerkutay?

908
01:29:12,360 --> 01:29:17,039
They are terrible people. They
even use their own daughter.

909
01:29:17,400 --> 01:29:18,959
What are you saying, Ulgen?

910
01:29:19,040 --> 01:29:22,159
They threatened me too.

911
01:29:22,680 --> 01:29:26,279
Gonca obeyed her parents

912
01:29:26,320 --> 01:29:28,079
and spied for them.

913
01:29:28,120 --> 01:29:31,839
Ulgen, I've been waiting for you to speak.

914
01:29:31,840 --> 01:29:33,319
Why didn't you say it before?

915
01:29:33,360 --> 01:29:37,799
Saadet threatened to kill Ghazi, Bala Hatun.

916
01:29:38,800 --> 01:29:42,599
My Bey, we had no other
choice but to stay silent.

917
01:29:49,120 --> 01:29:50,999
Why

918
01:29:51,400 --> 01:29:54,119
didn't you say it to me somehow?

919
01:29:54,200 --> 01:29:59,439
I wouldn't betray you even if they skinned me,

920
01:29:59,800 --> 01:30:03,039
just like I've never done before.

921
01:30:03,800 --> 01:30:05,879
But my family

922
01:30:06,680 --> 01:30:10,119
my child...

923
01:30:10,800 --> 01:30:12,879
Forgive me.

924
01:30:27,000 --> 01:30:29,679
For your child

925
01:30:30,440 --> 01:30:32,439
for your family

926
01:30:36,760 --> 01:30:39,359
I will skin you.

927
01:30:47,200 --> 01:30:48,639
My Bey.

928
01:30:48,880 --> 01:30:50,759
What's on your mind?

929
01:30:51,000 --> 01:30:54,039
With Cerkutay,

930
01:30:54,520 --> 01:30:57,959
we will reveal Yakup's treason.

931
01:31:09,600 --> 01:31:11,319
Orhan.

932
01:31:12,320 --> 01:31:15,239
You will go to Gorklu Khan.

933
01:31:15,720 --> 01:31:17,959
Bring me my horse.

934
01:31:18,080 --> 01:31:19,959
Come on.

935
01:31:31,960 --> 01:31:34,399
Tie him to the pole.

936
01:31:35,000 --> 01:31:38,399
He will stay there until I come back.

937
01:32:39,360 --> 01:32:41,719
I know what to do.

938
01:32:42,080 --> 01:32:45,399
I won't waste our efforts and sultanate...

939
01:32:45,560 --> 01:32:48,399
...for a worthless spy.

940
01:33:07,240 --> 01:33:10,199
I hope you keep your promise, Shahzade Orhan.

941
01:33:15,880 --> 01:33:18,439
I didn't give that promise for you...

942
01:33:19,120 --> 01:33:21,879
...but for my own people.

943
01:33:22,280 --> 01:33:25,119
It's also beneficial for me
to give the princess away.

944
01:33:25,160 --> 01:33:27,479
Don't be worrying.

945
01:33:47,480 --> 01:33:50,639
I'm really sorry about what happened, Orhan.

946
01:33:51,000 --> 01:33:54,279
-What happened between you and your father...
-Don't.

947
01:33:55,720 --> 01:33:58,159
Don't be sorry.

948
01:33:59,080 --> 01:34:01,799
Always smile, Lord's daughter.

949
01:34:08,080 --> 01:34:10,079
You know what?

950
01:34:10,640 --> 01:34:13,519
I would risk everything for you.

951
01:34:14,360 --> 01:34:16,279
I was going to run away.

952
01:34:16,560 --> 01:34:18,799
And come to you.

953
01:34:20,240 --> 01:34:22,719
But I came to you.

954
01:34:23,760 --> 01:34:25,759
You did.

955
01:34:28,400 --> 01:34:31,399
-Orhan.
-Go ahead.

956
01:34:33,120 --> 01:34:34,919
Even if...

957
01:34:35,200 --> 01:34:37,639
...you aren't a bey

958
01:34:39,840 --> 01:34:43,359
Even if you don't own a land

959
01:34:47,560 --> 01:34:49,959
...my heart...

960
01:34:50,480 --> 01:34:52,679
...belongs to you.

961
01:34:56,320 --> 01:34:59,719
Don't you forget that, alright?

962
01:35:04,480 --> 01:35:07,279
Mine too.

963
01:35:09,520 --> 01:35:12,719
My heart always belong to you.

964
01:35:13,960 --> 01:35:17,039
And it will always be so, Lord's daughter.

965
01:35:31,480 --> 01:35:33,959
Holofira.

966
01:35:34,560 --> 01:35:37,559
Shahzade Orhan is in a hurry.

967
01:35:44,360 --> 01:35:46,839
Stay safe.

968
01:36:18,520 --> 01:36:23,119
I've found the princess!

969
01:36:23,640 --> 01:36:24,839
How?

970
01:36:29,800 --> 01:36:32,799
Osman's son Orhan came to me.

971
01:36:32,880 --> 01:36:35,390
He's uncomfortable with his father's moves.

972
01:36:35,390 --> 01:36:38,360
He wants to give the princess away
and close the matter.

973
01:36:38,360 --> 01:36:41,919
The bigger matter will begin...

974
01:36:42,040 --> 01:36:44,479
...after we take the princess.

975
01:36:52,000 --> 01:36:55,399
-Where?
-They keep her in a house in Gokpinar.

976
01:36:55,600 --> 01:36:58,679
Orhan is going there with my soldiers.

977
01:36:58,800 --> 01:37:01,079
He doesn't even have a sword.

978
01:37:14,520 --> 01:37:16,799
It's from our spy in Yenisehir.

979
01:37:17,200 --> 01:37:20,759
Osman is coming with his army.

980
01:37:22,960 --> 01:37:25,679
Osman is coming here.

981
01:37:26,400 --> 01:37:28,239
With Karacelasun...

982
01:37:28,400 --> 01:37:31,439
...you will take his head!

983
01:37:31,880 --> 01:37:35,399
I'm going to take the princess.

984
01:37:36,080 --> 01:37:38,719
If Osman survives

985
01:37:38,920 --> 01:37:41,839
...you will die!

986
01:37:42,720 --> 01:37:45,919
Tajeddin Noyan.. Before he comes

987
01:37:46,080 --> 01:37:48,079
...we will take care of this matter.

988
01:37:48,320 --> 01:37:51,439
Otherwise, Tajeddin Noyan...

989
01:37:51,480 --> 01:37:53,959
...will take care of us.

990
01:37:56,080 --> 01:37:58,079
Let's go!

991
01:38:25,240 --> 01:38:27,199
We'll find you!

992
01:39:24,120 --> 01:39:26,119
Tell me...

993
01:39:26,200 --> 01:39:28,679
...how I can get to Osman Bey's city Yenisehir.

994
01:39:28,720 --> 01:39:32,119
Tell me and I spare your life.

995
01:39:33,440 --> 01:39:35,439
You won't even if I tell you.

996
01:39:35,560 --> 01:39:37,679
Speak!

997
01:39:41,120 --> 01:39:43,239
I will find that palace eventually.

998
01:40:31,160 --> 01:40:33,359
Both the enemies outside...

999
01:40:33,360 --> 01:40:36,079
...and the jackals inside will be destroyed now.

1000
01:40:36,240 --> 01:40:38,719
Go, Mehmed. Go.

1001
01:40:57,080 --> 01:40:59,199
Before the arrow reaches the target,

1002
01:40:59,320 --> 01:41:02,279
...you will fall into my hands, Mehmed.

1003
01:41:18,240 --> 01:41:20,919
What's the matter, my Shahzade?

1004
01:41:26,920 --> 01:41:28,999
What are you doing, my Shahzade?

1005
01:41:29,200 --> 01:41:31,639
Don't do this.

1006
01:41:37,280 --> 01:41:39,479
As long as we keep the princess,

1007
01:41:39,800 --> 01:41:42,319
...our suffering won't end.

1008
01:41:44,800 --> 01:41:47,479
We have to do this Bayindir Bey.

1009
01:42:05,880 --> 01:42:08,279
Of course, you do.

1010
01:42:08,360 --> 01:42:12,719
What else can you even do against my power?

1011
01:42:43,440 --> 01:42:47,039
You'll get into the grave
with your secrets, Cerkutay.

1012
01:42:47,640 --> 01:42:51,279
We'll see if Osman can make your speak now.

1013
01:43:10,440 --> 01:43:13,999
You're trying to kill Cerkutay
and get away with this, huh?

1014
01:43:16,560 --> 01:43:19,759
The sun has risen and the
fog has cleared up, Mehmed.

1015
01:43:19,920 --> 01:43:22,679
Everybody will know about your betrayal!

1016
01:43:22,960 --> 01:43:25,559
Gonca saved you from me last time.

1017
01:43:25,840 --> 01:43:28,559
Who can save you now, Alaaddin?

1018
01:44:04,280 --> 01:44:06,879
Alaaddin!

1019
01:44:31,480 --> 01:44:34,679
I will take your life..

1020
01:44:37,560 --> 01:44:40,519
..before taking my wife.

1021
01:44:41,000 --> 01:44:43,799
What did you resist for?

1022
01:44:44,280 --> 01:44:47,919
Your father loses his life in my ambush..

1023
01:44:48,520 --> 01:44:52,079
..and you here, tired.

1024
01:44:53,200 --> 01:44:56,799
You are dead, Turk.

1025
01:45:10,560 --> 01:45:13,079
Osman.

1026
01:45:13,440 --> 01:45:15,199
Gorklu Khan.

1027
01:45:15,320 --> 01:45:17,759
You will neither have my son's life..

1028
01:45:17,800 --> 01:45:19,239
..nor your wife.

1029
01:45:19,280 --> 01:45:21,599
Today, death has come for you.

1030
01:45:21,720 --> 01:45:24,039
Bad news, Gorksuz Khan (Lowly Khan).

1031
01:45:24,120 --> 01:45:26,839
Today, you are prey.

1032
01:45:27,440 --> 01:45:29,399
And we hunters.

1033
01:45:30,320 --> 01:45:34,079
-Attack!
-Protect the Princess!

1034
01:45:52,320 --> 01:45:54,519
Come here.

1035
01:45:54,640 --> 01:45:57,119
Come!

1036
01:46:12,960 --> 01:46:15,879
We won't stop..

1037
01:46:16,320 --> 01:46:20,039
..until these dogs stop breathing!

1038
01:47:39,160 --> 01:47:43,359
You oppressed my people,
you oppressed my vassals!

1039
01:47:43,480 --> 01:47:45,839
Now, my anger will be upon you.

1040
01:47:57,920 --> 01:48:02,719
This is a war you can not win, Osman!

1041
01:48:02,960 --> 01:48:07,359
My end will bring yours!

1042
01:48:07,520 --> 01:48:11,279
The dark clouds over us will vanish when you do.

1043
01:48:11,360 --> 01:48:13,959
Then, we will unite!

1044
01:48:18,520 --> 01:48:21,879
I hear swords clashing..

1045
01:48:21,920 --> 01:48:25,399
..women screaming infants crying..

1046
01:48:25,440 --> 01:48:29,359
..nokers with torches, Osman!

1047
01:48:30,320 --> 01:48:33,479
They are coming for you!

1048
01:48:33,640 --> 01:48:37,679
Let them come!

1049
01:48:37,760 --> 01:48:40,679
We have enough land to bury them all!

1050
01:49:02,120 --> 01:49:04,359
Gorklu Khan.

1051
01:49:06,240 --> 01:49:09,839
I am the state..

1052
01:49:09,960 --> 01:49:12,519
..I am the Bey.

1053
01:49:39,520 --> 01:49:43,039
Son, you've achieved great. May you prosper.

1054
01:49:43,160 --> 01:49:44,919
Because of you, my Bey.

1055
01:49:45,040 --> 01:49:47,599
My heart cooled off..

1056
01:49:48,160 --> 01:49:50,559
..since you got this dog's head.

1057
01:49:52,440 --> 01:49:53,959
Come on now.

1058
01:49:54,160 --> 01:49:55,959
We're heading to Yenisehir.

1059
01:49:56,480 --> 01:49:59,279
Let us face with the traitors inside.

1060
01:49:59,400 --> 01:50:01,879
Come on now. Ayaz!

1061
01:50:02,000 --> 01:50:03,639
My Bey!

1062
01:50:04,040 --> 01:50:06,679
Bring this dog's head behind us.

1063
01:50:06,800 --> 01:50:09,239
As you command, my Bey.

1064
01:50:18,800 --> 01:50:20,759
Where is Osman Bey's palace?

1065
01:50:20,840 --> 01:50:23,959
Osman Bey's palace is at the end of the road.

1066
01:50:23,960 --> 01:50:27,439
However, you won't arrive there.

1067
01:50:27,520 --> 01:50:28,759
I will.

1068
01:50:29,160 --> 01:50:31,679
I will arrive at Yenisehir.

1069
01:50:31,720 --> 01:50:35,879
However, you will arrive at hell!

1070
01:51:10,840 --> 01:51:13,239
My people!

1071
01:51:15,000 --> 01:51:16,999
Look here.

1072
01:51:17,640 --> 01:51:19,359
Look here.

1073
01:51:29,120 --> 01:51:32,879
Yakup Bey, the Princess you
were looking for everywhere..

1074
01:51:32,960 --> 01:51:35,799
..is here now.

1075
01:51:39,240 --> 01:51:41,199
Come here.

1076
01:51:49,240 --> 01:51:52,079
And this is another one.

1077
01:51:54,200 --> 01:51:56,359
Gorklu Khan.

1078
01:51:56,520 --> 01:51:58,919
Whom you met in secrecy..

1079
01:52:04,640 --> 01:52:07,039
..at your home.

1080
01:52:18,200 --> 01:52:20,399
What did you do, Osman?

1081
01:52:20,640 --> 01:52:22,879
What is it?

1082
01:52:23,600 --> 01:52:26,279
There will be many more heads to roll.

1083
01:52:26,360 --> 01:52:28,359
Many.

1084
01:52:38,160 --> 01:52:40,279
Do hear what you're saying, Osman Bey?

1085
01:52:40,360 --> 01:52:42,559
Of course I do.

1086
01:52:45,360 --> 01:52:48,439
My Bey. Suleyman Bey..

1087
01:52:48,520 --> 01:52:52,319
..and Karesid Bey are waiting
with their armies at the gates.

1088
01:52:52,640 --> 01:52:54,759
Now speak, Osman Bey.

1089
01:52:54,840 --> 01:52:55,919
No.

1090
01:52:57,120 --> 01:53:01,159
Not like that. Beys will also hear..

1091
01:53:02,040 --> 01:53:05,639
..what I will say.

1092
01:53:06,400 --> 01:53:07,919
Let them come.

1093
01:53:08,840 --> 01:53:10,319
My Bey.

1094
01:53:10,720 --> 01:53:13,199
If Yakup Bey

1095
01:53:13,200 --> 01:53:15,159
does not leave until mid-afternoon

1096
01:53:15,160 --> 01:53:18,639
-it was ordered to burn Yenisehir down.
-No.

1097
01:53:18,960 --> 01:53:21,919
I cannot promise.

1098
01:53:23,000 --> 01:53:25,119
Beys will come here

1099
01:53:25,360 --> 01:53:29,559
and they will see the whole situation.

1100
01:55:00,840 --> 01:55:03,079
Get up!

1101
01:55:03,920 --> 01:55:06,319
Get up.

1102
01:55:06,600 --> 01:55:08,199
Get up!

1103
01:55:08,280 --> 01:55:11,799
I said get up!

1104
01:55:20,640 --> 01:55:23,959
Alaeddin. Alaeddin!

1105
01:55:24,120 --> 01:55:26,519
Everyone will see your true colors.

1106
01:55:26,720 --> 01:55:28,799
Everyone.

1107
01:55:30,920 --> 01:55:33,119
Move!

1108
01:55:45,560 --> 01:55:51,239
Osman Bey!

1109
01:55:51,400 --> 01:55:53,279
What are you trying to do?

1110
01:55:53,440 --> 01:55:58,359
How could you keep Sultan
Yakup in Yenisehir by force?

1111
01:56:02,800 --> 01:56:04,759
Gorklu Khan.

1112
01:56:05,080 --> 01:56:07,359
Osman Bey, you..

1113
01:56:07,400 --> 01:56:09,599
...did you kill Gorklu Khan?

1114
01:56:09,880 --> 01:56:11,559
Yes.

1115
01:56:12,320 --> 01:56:14,359
Yes.

1116
01:56:24,360 --> 01:56:27,319
Sultan Yakup was right.

1117
01:56:28,600 --> 01:56:33,679
And now did you kill the Ilkhanate Emir?

1118
01:56:34,320 --> 01:56:37,199
You will not stop

1119
01:56:37,280 --> 01:56:39,239
until you ruin the whole country.

1120
01:56:39,240 --> 01:56:44,759
Osman Bey is still the same.

1121
01:56:45,960 --> 01:56:49,599
He keeps swinging his sword

1122
01:56:49,760 --> 01:56:53,239
without knowing what's going to happen to him?

1123
01:56:54,840 --> 01:56:57,679
What about you?

1124
01:56:58,520 --> 01:57:01,319
Do you know what's going to happen to you?

1125
01:57:02,720 --> 01:57:06,119
Tell me, do you know, Yakup Bey?

1126
01:57:06,360 --> 01:57:07,719
Move!

1127
01:57:07,840 --> 01:57:10,359
Let go off me! Don't touch me!

1128
01:57:10,440 --> 01:57:13,639
Let go off me! -Mehmed.

1129
01:57:13,640 --> 01:57:16,159
Brother?

1130
01:57:17,280 --> 01:57:18,959
Let go off me.

1131
01:57:29,600 --> 01:57:32,359
You've been exposed, Yakup Bey.

1132
01:57:34,600 --> 01:57:37,399
Mehmed Bey, son of Yakup Bey,

1133
01:57:37,560 --> 01:57:40,239
tried to shoot Cerkutay

1134
01:57:40,480 --> 01:57:43,919
when his treason is exposed.

1135
01:57:44,320 --> 01:57:46,919
Not only Cerkutay,

1136
01:57:47,120 --> 01:57:49,159
tell me,

1137
01:57:49,200 --> 01:57:51,719
tell me

1138
01:57:51,800 --> 01:57:53,279
How can

1139
01:57:53,400 --> 01:57:57,159
a man make his daughter a spy?

1140
01:58:00,960 --> 01:58:03,919
What are you saying, Osman Bey?

1141
01:58:05,240 --> 01:58:07,479
Here's your Hatun.

1142
01:58:07,560 --> 01:58:09,199
Here are your children.

1143
01:58:09,320 --> 01:58:12,759
They're here, ask them.

1144
01:58:29,440 --> 01:58:33,279
But you didn't threaten only Cerkutay.

1145
01:58:33,520 --> 01:58:35,559
Not only Ulgen,

1146
01:58:35,680 --> 01:58:38,679
not only your daughter,

1147
01:58:39,800 --> 01:58:42,279
tell me, Beys.

1148
01:58:43,040 --> 01:58:45,679
Are you staying there voluntarily?

1149
01:58:46,160 --> 01:58:48,919
Tell me, are you staying there voluntarily?

1150
01:59:16,840 --> 01:59:19,039
It was not honorable.

1151
01:59:19,320 --> 01:59:23,399
So you've heard about what happened, Osman Bey.

1152
01:59:25,480 --> 01:59:30,319
Is this true, Sultan Yakup?

1153
01:59:31,680 --> 01:59:33,599
Better late

1154
01:59:33,720 --> 01:59:36,879
than never.

1155
01:59:37,760 --> 01:59:39,999
The cruel Sultan

1156
01:59:40,000 --> 01:59:42,879
lives short.

1157
01:59:51,400 --> 01:59:53,199
Now.

1158
01:59:55,360 --> 01:59:58,519
Now, what should I do to you, Yakup Bey?

1159
01:59:59,480 --> 02:00:01,599
If I try to kill you

1160
02:00:02,120 --> 02:00:04,959
then brothers' blood will be spilled.

1161
02:00:05,080 --> 02:00:07,639
They will come after me for revenge.

1162
02:00:07,840 --> 02:00:10,799
If I embrace you

1163
02:00:10,920 --> 02:00:13,239
as my brother

1164
02:00:18,080 --> 02:00:22,079
I don't feel well about it.

1165
02:00:23,160 --> 02:00:25,639
Tell me Yakup Bey.

1166
02:00:26,520 --> 02:00:28,759
What should I do?

1167
02:00:30,600 --> 02:00:34,559
What would you do

1168
02:00:35,480 --> 02:00:38,159
if you were me.

1169
02:01:08,560 --> 02:01:10,959
Not a single word you've just said

1170
02:01:11,120 --> 02:01:13,799
is wrong.

1171
02:01:14,280 --> 02:01:16,999
What you say is true.

1172
02:01:18,920 --> 02:01:24,159
In this case, if it was me
who was holding the sword

1173
02:01:24,720 --> 02:01:27,879
If I were you

1174
02:01:28,360 --> 02:01:31,119
I would kill you

1175
02:01:31,440 --> 02:01:34,759
just like Gorklu Khan.

1176
02:01:35,320 --> 02:01:39,079
Ah, Yakup Bey.

1177
02:01:40,400 --> 02:01:42,719
Whatever I did,

1178
02:01:42,720 --> 02:01:45,559
I did it for my country...

1179
02:01:45,760 --> 02:01:48,679
My Sultan! Be careful!

1180
02:01:48,880 --> 02:01:51,719
My Sultan!

1181
02:01:51,760 --> 02:01:56,599
-Father! Father!
-My Sultan!

1182
02:01:56,680 --> 02:01:59,719
-Father!
-Who shot an arrow?

1183
02:01:59,760 --> 02:02:02,999
Osman! You did it!

1184
02:02:03,280 --> 02:02:05,639
I swear I'll kill you!

1185
02:02:05,760 --> 02:02:07,879
I'll kill you!

1186
02:02:08,160 --> 02:02:11,839
They want to make us kill our brothers.

1187
02:02:12,360 --> 02:02:15,879
Alps! Come on!

1188
02:02:16,400 --> 02:02:19,999
-Call our doctors, come on!
-Father!

1189
02:02:20,120 --> 02:02:22,959
-My Sultan!
-We will go to the palace.

1190
02:02:23,000 --> 02:02:24,719
If something happens to my man

1191
02:02:24,760 --> 02:02:26,919
I'll burn Yenisehir down!

1192
02:02:27,520 --> 02:02:29,479
-I'll burn it down!
-Let go off me.

1193
02:02:29,520 --> 02:02:31,079
Let go off me, I'll kill him!

1194
02:02:31,240 --> 02:02:32,679
I'll find that dastard!

1195
02:02:32,680 --> 02:02:34,719
You're arrested Mehmed.

1196
02:02:34,840 --> 02:02:36,679
You can't go anywhere.

1197
02:02:37,200 --> 02:02:39,999
I'll kill you all if something happens to him.

1198
02:02:40,160 --> 02:02:42,479
Come on, hurry up!

1199
02:02:43,280 --> 02:02:45,839
Yakup Bey!

1200
02:02:47,400 --> 02:02:50,239
Come on, hurry up!

1201
02:02:55,480 --> 02:02:58,239
-Come on!
-Father!

1202
02:03:12,720 --> 02:03:15,719
Alps, bring the horses.

1203
02:03:37,800 --> 02:03:39,999
The traces divide into two here.

1204
02:03:40,040 --> 02:03:42,999
Alps, you will go this way.

1205
02:03:43,040 --> 02:03:47,079
Orhan and I will go this way. Do not come
back to Yenisehir before you find the girl.

1206
02:03:47,080 --> 02:03:50,319
Come on! Come on Orhan.

1207
02:04:07,400 --> 02:04:09,879
Father, father.

1208
02:04:10,280 --> 02:04:12,399
Lift him, Kanyumaz.

1209
02:04:13,680 --> 02:04:17,439
Father, hang on.

1210
02:04:18,320 --> 02:04:23,439
-Hang on, father!
-Father!

1211
02:04:24,080 --> 02:04:27,879
-Father.
-They killed my Bey.

1212
02:04:30,520 --> 02:04:32,159
Open the wound first.

1213
02:04:32,280 --> 02:04:34,519
Stay away! I'll not let you treat my father!

1214
02:04:34,560 --> 02:04:36,639
Move away, we're losing time.

1215
02:04:36,800 --> 02:04:39,799
Our doctors will come,
no one will touch my father.

1216
02:04:39,880 --> 02:04:41,159
No one will touch him!

1217
02:04:41,160 --> 02:04:43,159
Your father is dying and you keep talking

1218
02:04:43,200 --> 02:04:45,377
-Yakup Bey will die until
the doctor comes, Mehmed.

1219
02:04:45,389 --> 02:04:46,119
Brother!

1220
02:04:46,120 --> 02:04:48,519
Move! Let Alaeddin check him!

1221
02:04:48,520 --> 02:04:51,719
He saved you, don't you remember?
We don't have any other choice!

1222
02:04:51,720 --> 02:04:54,399
Do you still trust them Gonca, huh?

1223
02:04:54,480 --> 02:04:57,759
It's a game! They did this to my father!

1224
02:04:57,960 --> 02:05:01,119
Baysungur!

1225
02:05:01,320 --> 02:05:03,599
Move! Alaeddin!

1226
02:05:03,680 --> 02:05:06,719
I won't let you live if something
happens to my father, I swear!

1227
02:05:06,720 --> 02:05:09,959
Enough, Mehmet! We are
all trying to help him survive.

1228
02:05:12,040 --> 02:05:14,119
If my Bey dies...

1229
02:05:14,320 --> 02:05:16,959
...you will pay for this, Alaeddin.

1230
02:05:17,160 --> 02:05:19,199
I will make you
all pay for this.

1231
02:05:19,400 --> 02:05:21,679
If we lose any more time he will die anyway.

1232
02:05:21,800 --> 02:05:24,159
Step back.

1233
02:05:27,880 --> 02:05:31,679
-Hang on, Yakup Bey.
-Father.

1234
02:05:34,320 --> 02:05:37,079
Cerkutay ran away!

1235
02:05:52,720 --> 02:05:54,399
My Bey...

1236
02:05:54,800 --> 02:05:57,399
They killed our Alps.

1237
02:05:58,320 --> 02:06:00,719
There might be a trap.

1238
02:07:09,520 --> 02:07:11,239
My son.

1239
02:07:11,520 --> 02:07:14,399
Stop, don't kill her!

1240
02:07:19,040 --> 02:07:22,839
Do not shed a Hatun's blood with my sword.

1241
02:07:24,800 --> 02:07:26,639
Who hired you?

1242
02:07:26,840 --> 02:07:29,359
You are not Mongols.

1243
02:07:29,680 --> 02:07:31,359
You are Kayi.

1244
02:07:32,240 --> 02:07:35,279
I thought you were Mongols,
that's why I drew my sword.

1245
02:07:35,480 --> 02:07:38,559
I wanted to take your horse and go to Osman Bey.

1246
02:07:39,280 --> 02:07:41,439
What are you going to do with Osman Bey?

1247
02:07:41,520 --> 02:07:46,119
They will kill Osman Bey
and slaughter everyone in Kayi.

1248
02:07:47,400 --> 02:07:49,439
Who will do that?

1249
02:07:49,480 --> 02:07:51,799
Tajeddin Noyan!

1250
02:07:54,080 --> 02:07:56,199
Tajeddin Noyan...

1251
02:08:08,600 --> 02:08:11,319
Hang on, father, please!

1252
02:08:24,560 --> 02:08:28,159
No, no... The bleeding does not stop
Alaeddin. What are we going to do?

1253
02:08:28,280 --> 02:08:30,599
Keep it on the wound!

1254
02:08:31,720 --> 02:08:35,399
Mother! Is the ointment ready?
-Almost.

1255
02:08:39,960 --> 02:08:41,399
Father, hang on, please!

1256
02:08:41,440 --> 02:08:44,319
Father, please, hang on!

1257
02:08:44,600 --> 02:08:46,839
My Allah, help me! -Put it in his mouth.

1258
02:08:47,080 --> 02:08:49,599
Alright.

1259
02:08:53,240 --> 02:08:56,599
Hang on, father, please! Please!

1260
02:08:58,080 --> 02:09:00,359
Let me see..

1261
02:09:00,440 --> 02:09:03,039
In the name of Allah, the merciful, the compassionate

1262
02:09:03,200 --> 02:09:06,759
O Healer...O Allah!

1263
02:09:17,480 --> 02:09:20,679
Hang on.. -Gonca, apply some of this ointment.

1264
02:09:20,760 --> 02:09:22,559
Alright.

1265
02:09:28,560 --> 02:09:30,359
Father?

1266
02:09:30,680 --> 02:09:33,399
Father! Father! Alaeddin!
-Yakup!

1267
02:09:33,440 --> 02:09:35,719
Alaeddin! My father does not breathe!

1268
02:09:35,800 --> 02:09:38,519
Father! -Father! Alaeddin!

1269
02:09:38,840 --> 02:09:45,719
Father! Father! Father!

1270
02:09:45,960 --> 02:09:47,519
Father!

1271
02:09:47,640 --> 02:09:50,799
Alaeddin, help! My father does not breathe!

1272
02:09:50,840 --> 02:09:54,679
Father! Father! Father!

1273
02:09:54,960 --> 02:09:58,519
Father! Help, please! -You took...

1274
02:09:58,600 --> 02:10:00,679
...my Bey from me.

1275
02:10:01,720 --> 02:10:03,719
And I will..

1276
02:10:03,840 --> 02:10:07,079
...take your lives.

1277
02:10:11,080 --> 02:10:14,039
Mother!

1278
02:10:19,120 --> 02:10:22,639
What does Ilkhanate's Sultan
Olcaytu's nephew Tajeddin Noyan...

1279
02:10:22,760 --> 02:10:24,679
...want from Osman Bey, huh?

1280
02:10:24,680 --> 02:10:28,359
He abducted the Princess of
Byzantium and announced his Beylic.

1281
02:10:28,440 --> 02:10:30,519
And the dogs he sent...

1282
02:10:30,600 --> 02:10:32,879
...could not defeat Osman Bey.

1283
02:10:33,480 --> 02:10:35,679
Isn't it enough?

1284
02:10:37,880 --> 02:10:39,679
How do you know these things?

1285
02:10:39,760 --> 02:10:43,159
My father and my martyr
brother's wife are in their hands.

1286
02:10:43,200 --> 02:10:46,599
I ran away from them, and I am
going to take refuge in Osman Bey.

1287
02:10:46,600 --> 02:10:48,799
I know that valiant Osman Bey...

1288
02:10:48,840 --> 02:10:51,319
...will not leave my father alone with his fate.

1289
02:10:51,320 --> 02:10:52,879
Who is your father?

1290
02:10:53,000 --> 02:10:54,199
Who are you?

1291
02:10:54,320 --> 02:10:56,719
I am Akbasli Gunduz Bey's daughter.

1292
02:10:57,360 --> 02:10:59,919
From Kayi tribe, Hayme Ana's family...

1293
02:11:00,000 --> 02:11:03,039
...Efendize Elcim Hatun.

1294
02:11:06,800 --> 02:11:08,679
Father...

1295
02:11:08,920 --> 02:11:10,839
This Hatun killed our Alps.

1296
02:11:10,960 --> 02:11:13,119
She is lying to save her life.

1297
02:11:13,320 --> 02:11:16,359
They were not your Alps!

1298
02:11:17,840 --> 02:11:19,719
Go and check them.

1299
02:11:43,200 --> 02:11:45,679
My Bey. She is telling the truth.

1300
02:11:45,800 --> 02:11:48,079
They are Mongol dogs.

1301
02:12:14,520 --> 02:12:16,999
Who are you?

1302
02:12:17,040 --> 02:12:19,839
Osman Bey is standing right in front of you.

1303
02:12:23,280 --> 02:12:26,039
Now you know who we are.

1304
02:12:28,440 --> 02:12:31,279
Now it is their turn!

1305
02:12:49,600 --> 02:12:51,319
Alps!

1306
02:12:51,320 --> 02:12:55,119
Aren't you ashamed of drawing your
swords against your brothers, huh?

1307
02:12:55,120 --> 02:12:58,439
This woman shed our brothers' blood!

1308
02:12:58,680 --> 02:13:00,439
She is a spy!

1309
02:13:00,480 --> 02:13:03,039
Give that woman to us!

1310
02:13:07,600 --> 02:13:09,719
She killed my Alps!

1311
02:13:10,080 --> 02:13:11,896
My Bey, what are you doing?

1312
02:13:11,908 --> 02:13:14,519
I will take my
revenge from her first!

1313
02:13:15,320 --> 02:13:17,279
Do not rise difficulties.

1314
02:13:17,440 --> 02:13:20,839
Give that Hatun to us and go your own way.

1315
02:13:21,640 --> 02:13:23,959
Look! Don't take another step!

1316
02:13:24,080 --> 02:13:26,879
Don't take another step!
Or I will cut her head off!

1317
02:13:27,040 --> 02:13:29,879
I said give that woman to us, Alp
-Apparently...

1318
02:13:31,760 --> 02:13:33,879
..you don't know us.

1319
02:13:33,920 --> 02:13:36,839
It seems that your anger is stronger.

1320
02:13:37,000 --> 02:13:38,959
But...

1321
02:13:39,120 --> 02:13:41,319
...I caught this Hatun first.

1322
02:13:41,400 --> 02:13:45,359
Therefore, I will take my revenge!

1323
02:13:55,000 --> 02:13:58,199
Now... If...

1324
02:13:59,240 --> 02:14:02,679
..if you want this Hatun..

1325
02:14:05,360 --> 02:14:06,959
...you will drop your swords.

1326
02:14:07,080 --> 02:14:10,599
You will drop your swords, not us!

1327
02:14:10,640 --> 02:14:12,599
Drop your swords!

1328
02:14:12,680 --> 02:14:14,559
Let me go! Let me go!

1329
02:14:14,600 --> 02:14:16,759
You dastards! Let me go!

1330
02:14:16,760 --> 02:14:18,919
Shut up, Hatun!

1331
02:14:28,440 --> 02:14:31,159
Don't take another step!

1332
02:14:43,040 --> 02:14:44,359
Drop it, my son.

1333
02:14:44,440 --> 02:14:47,839
Drop it.

1334
02:14:48,000 --> 02:14:50,399
We are not going to die here for a Hatun.

1335
02:14:50,720 --> 02:14:52,759
You are trampling on your morals!

1336
02:14:52,760 --> 02:14:55,999
You are turning someone who took
refuge in you over to her enemies!

1337
02:14:56,000 --> 02:14:59,359
I told you to shut up, Hatun!

1338
02:15:00,640 --> 02:15:02,759
Take the girl.

1339
02:15:06,560 --> 02:15:08,999
Come. Come.

1340
02:15:15,520 --> 02:15:16,959
Take her.

1341
02:15:23,160 --> 02:15:27,759
When have I ever given someone innocent
who took refuge in me to someone else, huh?

1342
02:15:27,760 --> 02:15:29,759
My name is Osman Bey.

1343
02:15:30,040 --> 02:15:34,839
There is no such thing in
the state I am dreaming of.

1344
02:15:35,000 --> 02:15:36,519
Come at me now.

1345
02:15:36,864 --> 02:15:47,844
Visit turkision.com for more!